Z||000000||BENGAL4||02-16-2000||08:52 PM||||My oldest daughter and I, was on our way to watch the younger one play basketball and I got pulled over by Fairfield's finest. I should have been paying attention. I was trying to teach the older one, the joys of Van Halen. I was listening to Panama, off of the 1984 CD, had it cranked up and passed this cop doing 34 in a 25mph zone. She looked right at him but didn't tell me. I thought he would give me a break, but he didn't. Oh well, I proved my point. Van Halen kicks N-Sync's butt every time. I think I will turn her on to Rush next. Working Man maybe?||||reg||8
