Z||000011||BENGAL4||02-17-2000||09:51 PM||||I just recently purchased "RUSH Chronicles". It takes me back to my high school and college days. My favorite has to be "Working Man". I also like Anthem, Bastille Day, and Fly by Night. I also like some of the later songs like Tom Sayer, Red Barchetta and Limelite. I think they are the best power trio, I've ever heard. Neal Pert gets my vote as greatest rock drummer. The only bad thing about Working Man is, Pert's not playing on it.<P> My wife thinks I'm having a mid-life crisis. I told her, it's the Fiero and music that makes me feel 21 again. Now if I can only get her to listen to Creed and Nirvana. She does like Queen and REO Speedwagon though. Next up for the kid's is a little Sammy Hagar, how about Red or Bad Motor Scooter(from his Montrose days)? ||||reg||6
